00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:02.090
It means that you can really
manage your local knowledge

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.820
with a local chat UI,
which has been connected

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:09.050
to a local RAG logic behind
the scenes that now also,

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:11.090
for the first time,
can take action.

00:21:11.090 --> 00:21:12.920
This is one of the
preview announcements

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:14.840
that we are making today.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:19.820
And there is an option either
