and need as we go.

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:51.330
So it's just a matter
of allowing you

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:55.830
to manage your knowledge
through agentic RAG, reasoning,

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.830
and grounding capabilities,
as well as to be able

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:06.810
to invoke some tooling and
making some agentic flows

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:08.970
that can run automatically.

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:12.000
Now, here is just an example
how things are being

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:12.990
modeled together.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:19.410
So, at the top, you see
the knowledge pipeline.

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:21.150
When a user asks a question

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:24.930
and then the agent
first plans the query.

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:27.480
It decides what to search for.

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:30.630
Then it selects which
knowledge sources to hit.

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:34.710
And finally, it merge the
result into a grounded answer.

00:22:34.710 --> 00:22:37.200
And here's the key part.

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:40.320
This is iterative.

00:22:40.320 --> 00:22:43.230
I mean, you can run it in
a couple of iterations.

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:45.090
If the agent look at the results

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:48.660
and decide doesn't have
enough, then it loops back.

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:50.250
It rewrites the queries.

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:51.480
It expands the scope.

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:52.710
It retrieves again.

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:54.930
That's what makes
it an agentic RAG.

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:59.370
And it keeps going until it has
a high confidence evidence,

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:02.280
or it hits the
configured effort limit.

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:03.750
All of this runs locally.

00:23:03.750 --> 00:23:05.430
No cloud calls.

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:10.720
Every response is traceable
back to the source document.

00:23:11.850 --> 00:23:14.580
